{%- comment -%}
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
RUG SIZES (Corvo addition)
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Prints the standard sizes of a rug: one entry per size, whatever other choices the rug has (a colour, a frame). A rug
with five sizes and twenty colours has a hundred variants and still five standard sizes.

The sizes are the values of the choice named "Size" (or of the only choice of the rug). A size reads as
"150x200 cm" for a rectangle and as "Ø200 cm" for a round rug.

What is printed is made to be cut up by the caller: entries are separated by "§" and, inside an entry, fields by "|":

  shape | width | length | price | code | variant | label

* shape: "rect", "round", or "other" when the name of the size is not a measure
* width and length: in centimetres (for a round rug both are its diameter; 0 when the shape is "other")
* price: the lowest price of that size, in cents
* code: the product code (SKU) of the first variant of that size
* variant: the ID of that variant
* label: the size in words, "150 × 200 cm" or "Ø 200 cm"

  capture size_lines
    render 'rug-sizes', product: product
  endcapture

  assign size_lines = size_lines | strip | split: '§'

********************************************
Supported variables
********************************************

* product: the rug (required)
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign size_position = 0

  for option in product.options_with_values
    assign option_name = option.name | downcase | strip

    if option_name == 'size'
      assign size_position = option.position
      break
    endif
  endfor

  if size_position == 0 and product.options.size == 1
    assign size_position = 1
  endif

  assign size_index = size_position | minus: 1
-%}

{%- unless product.has_only_default_variant or size_position == 0 -%}
  {%- for size_value in product.options_with_values[size_index].values -%}
    {%- liquid
      assign size_name = size_value.name | default: size_value | append: ''

      capture size_read
        render 'rug-size-read', size: size_name
      endcapture

      assign size_parts = size_read | strip | split: '|'
      assign size_shape = size_parts[0]
      assign size_width = size_parts[1] | plus: 0
      assign size_length = size_parts[2] | plus: 0
      assign size_label = size_name

      if size_shape == 'round'
        assign size_label = 'Ø ' | append: size_width | append: ' cm'
      elsif size_shape == 'rect'
        assign size_label = size_width | append: ' × ' | append: size_length | append: ' cm'
      endif

      assign size_price = -1
      assign size_code = ''
      assign size_variant_id = ''

      for size_variant in product.variants
        if size_variant.options[size_index] == size_name
          if size_price < 0
            assign size_code = size_variant.sku
            assign size_variant_id = size_variant.id
          endif

          if size_price < 0 or size_variant.price < size_price
            assign size_price = size_variant.price
          endif
        endif
      endfor
    -%}

    {%- if size_price >= 0 -%}
      {{- size_shape }}|{{ size_width }}|{{ size_length }}|{{ size_price }}|{{ size_code | remove: '|' | remove: '§' }}|{{ size_variant_id }}|{{ size_label | remove: '|' | remove: '§' }}§
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- endfor -%}
{%- endunless -%}
